THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
--------------------

Two inputs originate outside this repository and carry their own terms:

* The IEEE 33-bus line and load table (`case33bw`) is the benchmark of
  M. E. Baran and F. F. Wu, IEEE Trans. Power Delivery 4, 1401 (1989),
  doi:10.1109/61.25627, as distributed with MATPOWER and pandapower. It is
  cited as a data source; neither package is a dependency of this code.

* The canal section geometry, Manning roughness and gate discharge coefficient
  follow the published Canale Emiliano Romagnolo values of G. Luppi et al.,
  Water 10, 1017 (2018), doi:10.3390/w10081017, which is licensed CC BY 3.0.
  The remaining canal parameters are declared design assumptions of this work.


